# College Portal & Reporting API Foundations

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates a College Portal Reporting System built using Python in Google Colab.

The project performs:

- Data Loading
- Data Cleaning
- Data Analysis
- KPI Generation
- Data Visualization
- Department Report
- Placement Report
- Student Performance Analysis
- Report Generation
- JSON and CSV Export

## Dataset

Sample_Dataset.xlsx

## Tools Used

- Python
- Google Colab
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- OpenPyXL

## Output Files

- Sample_Dataset.xlsx
- College_Final_Report.xlsx
- College_Dataset.csv
- Department_Report.csv
- Placement_Report.csv
- College_Report.json

## Project Features

- Student Dashboard
- Department-wise Analysis
- Placement Analysis
- Attendance Report
- Marks Analysis
- CGPA Analysis
- Executive Summary Report
- CSV Export
- JSON Report Export

